## Command

```shell
biome lint --only=nursery/noTailwindRestrictedClasses '<TEMP_DIR>/no_tailwind_restricted_classes_reads_stylesheet_utilities'
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{
  "html": { "linter": { "enabled": true } },
  "tailwind": { "stylesheet": "./src/app.css" },
  "linter": {
    "rules": {
      "nursery": {
        "noTailwindRestrictedClasses": {
          "level": "error",
          "options": {
            "classes": {
              "slide-in-from-top-*": "Use the enter animation preset.",
              "enter-legacy": { "use": "slide-in-from-top-4" }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

## `src/App.jsx`

```jsx
export const a = <div className="md:slide-in-from-top-4 flex" />;
export const b = <div className="enter-legacy" />;

```

## `src/app.css`

```css
@utility slide-in-from-top-* {
    --tw-enter-translate-y: calc(--value(integer) * var(--spacing));
}
```

## `src/index.html`

```html
<div class="slide-in-from-top-[48%] flex"></div>

```

